            "title": "Tidal Tunnels",
            "body": "<p class='basic'>Locations with unrevealed Tidal Tunnel sides exist in multiple encounter sets. (For example, in this scenario, both the Flooded Caverns encounter set and The Pit of Despair encounter set contain unrevealed Tidal Tunnel locations.) Because these locations can come from multiple different encounter sets, they have no encounter set icon on their unrevealed side. To see which encounter set a Tidal Tunnel location belongs to, check its revealed side.</p>"
