          "gatherSets": "Gather all cards from the following encounter sets: *In Too Deep*, *Creatures of the Deep*, *Rising Tide*, *Syzygy*, *The Locals*, and *Agents of Cthulhu*. These sets are indicated by the following icons:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/in-too-deep.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/undersea-creatures.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/rising-tide.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/syzygy.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/locals.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/agents-of-cthulhu.png' /></section>",
