          "gatherSets": "Gather all cards from the following encounter sets: *The Lair of Dagon*, *Agents of Dagon*, *Flooded Caverns*, *Syzygy*, *Dark Cult*, and *Locked Doors*. These sets are indicated by the following icons:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/lair-of-dagon.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/agents-of-dagon.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/flooded-caves.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/syzygy.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/dark-cult.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/locked-doors.png' /></section>",
