          "facedownKeys": "Set the white and yellow keys aside, facedown. Shuffle them so you do not know which is which.",
          "placeLocations": "Put the following locations into play: Grand Entryway, Foul Corridors, both copies of First Floor Hall, both copies of Second Floor Hall, and Third Floor Hall.",
