          "setAsideCards": "Set the following cards aside, out of play: both copies of the Syzygy treachery, both copies of the Tidal Alignment treachery, the double-sided Y’ha-nthlei Statue story asset, the Apostle of Dagon enemy, and the double-sided Dagon enemy.",
