          "fiveToSeven": "…5–7 memories recorded, add 2 {'{'}curse{'}'} tokens to the chaos bag.",
          "eightOrMore": "…8 or more memories recorded, add 5 {'{'}curse{'}'} tokens to the chaos bag.",
