          "whatLurksBelowV2": "Otherwise, set Thomas Dawson aside, out of play. When constructing the agenda deck, use Agenda 2a—“What Lurks Below (v. II)” and remove Agenda 2a—“What Lurks Below (v. I)” from the game.",
