          "gatherSets": "Gather all cards from the following encounter sets: *Into the Maelstrom*, *Agents of Hydra*, *Creatures of the Deep*, *Flooded Caverns*, *Shattered Memories*, *Syzygy*, and *Ancient Evils*. These sets are indicated by the following icons:<section class='encounter-sets'><img src='{setImgPath}/into-the-maelstrom.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/agents-of-hydra.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/undersea-creatures.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/flooded-caves.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/shattered-memories.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/syzygy.png' /><img src='{setImgPath}/ancient-evils.png' /></section>",
